content.text:
The evidence points to one root cause: the search service has no running pod for the whole abnormal window, and its frontend calls fail.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "search",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT time, metric, value, attr_k8s_deployment_name FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric='k8s.deployment.available' AND attr_k8s_deployment_name='search' ORDER BY time LIMIT 20",
          "claim": "search deployment available is 0 across the abnormal window, while desired stays 1 and normal is 1."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_pod_name, attr_k8s_container_name, min(value) AS min_restarts, max(value) AS max_restarts FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric='k8s.container.restarts' AND attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'search%' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "The search container restart count climbs from 4 to 8 in the abnormal period, against a flat 3 in normal."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n, approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6 AS p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name='search.Search/Nearby' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Frontend's search.Search/Nearby client calls all return Error in about 0.015 ms; none reach search."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('search','geo','rate') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "search, and the geo and rate services it calls, emit no spans at all in the abnormal period."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "search",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_http_response_status_code, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name='HTTP /hotels' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "frontend's HTTP /hotels server spans return 500 Error in the abnormal period, against 200 in normal."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

